        "text": "<thinking> To create the `translate_text.py` file, I need to integrate a concrete external translation provider. I will use the Google Cloud Translation API for this task. The integration will be identifiable by the import of the `google.cloud.translate` module and the use of the `TranslateClient` class. </thinking>\n",
